          "justification": "TypeScript/JavaScript number is IEEE-754 binary64 rather than a signed 32-bit integer type. ToInt32 coercion through a bitwise operator is a conversion substitute for the required fixed-width binding, and F08.P1 has no R9 substitution. The prior FULL/P-a interpretations are therefore NONE under the current rubric.",
