          "conclusion": "TypeScript number is JavaScript/ECMAScript Number and there is no distinct int runtime primitive. ECMAScript Number uses IEEE-754 binary64; bitwise ToInt32 coercion or Int32Array storage is a conversion/container substitute, not signed-32-bit scalar arithmetic with the canonical operation.",
